from ui_incremental import *
record(P+'ViewModels/MenuEditorViewModel.cs','Explicit category/product/variant/tax/price-rule/image management editor.',[
('OpenAsync','Any menu/settings/offers permission can open editor internally, but shell only exposes Menu under menu_manage and Settings separate; offers-only entry reachability must be cross-checked. CanBrowse excludes pending generic journal but not image busy. Recovered pending can make Load return before any catalog/form appears, Save retry exists but native visibility HasEditor may hide it.'),
('ReloadAsync','Sequential reads categories/allproducts/recipes/tax/prices regardless chosen kind; first denied endpoint blocks entire editor for otherwise authorized tax/offer-only manager. IsReady only after all reads. Retains unavailable linked recipe placeholder to avoid silently dropping existing ID.'),
('SetKind','Known4kinds only, resets editing/error/image and refreshes rows/gates. RefreshRows filters actual snapshots by name/details; no DB writes. Product display baseprice may differ from variant min but editor explicit base field not sale estimate.'),
('SelectRow','Copies selected actual typed record into form; taxRate uses CashInput format of basispoints so percent parsing100matches stored units. Category choice membership checked on save; Station not membership checked but server enum validation remains needed.'),
('ChooseImageAsync','Captures product before file-picker await, size checked AFTER platform reads full bytes. Upload immediately outside generic formSave/journal by explicit design. IsImageBusy only gates image controls, not CanBrowse/CanEdit; selecting B during A upload allowed in VM. Success overwrites _editing with capturedA and newVersion regardless current selection then Reload, possibly targetingAwithBvisibleform on later save. Parent alerted source race, native callsite mitigation pending.'),
('RemoveImageAsync','Same stale _editing overwrite after awaited delete; file actual backend mutation immediate, not cancelled by closing form. No global session busy for image action, token/user can change before captured CurrentUser after picker.'),
('CreateRequest','Name mandatory, invariant intsort, positive strictmoney, actual category/station/product/variant IDs, known tax mode and bounded basispoints int; price rule needs productIDs, optional days nullmeansall and TimeOnlyHH:mm. No local start/end consistency/domain range, server validation required. New records Active false defaults tax/prices intentional but UI must make disabled state clear.'),
('SaveAsync','Retained exact generic DTO before send; dispatch9knowncreate/update/toggle shapes, does not reread form on retry. Submit closes editor on confirmed outcome and reloads. ToggleStatus actual category.Active/product.IsAvailable inverse capturedonce, journal stable across ambiguity.'),
('TryTime','Empty nullable or exact HH:mm invariant; invalid returns ActionError. AddVariant/RemoveVariant guarded CanEdit but not IsImageBusy, same mixed action context concern.')],
'Need delayed imageAselectB/formsave test and close/lock while upload; authority-only permission matrix, generic recovered retry HasEditor visibility and linked missing recipe preservation. No files picked or product/tax/price mutations executed.',
'Freeze selection/global navigation while image operation or validate generation before all response mutations; keep immutable target independent visible form, per-role loading and explicit recovered panel.')
record(P+'ViewModels/DeliveryViewModel.cs','Dispatch board, real driver directory, assignment/outcome/custody settlement.',[
('LoadAsync','Real board then active drivers, no auto-refresh timer/version/cancellation; row elapsed/slow are computed DateTimeUtc getters but no timer notifications so delay ages only repaint/reload. BoardSummary strings real counts, cannot claim realtime updates continuously.'),
('BoardRow','Customer/address/phone from actual delivery DTO, distinguishes pendingElectronic vs prepaid vsCOD. Pending compare exact Pending enum-style unlike checkout lowercasepending; server DTO uses enum names parent cross-check. Amount0shows dash even prepaid explained text.'),
('MarkReadyAsync','Permission+edit gate, real status transition no retained DTO/outcomeUnknown identity but intended monotonic state setter; first unknown after committed ready should reconcile board rather than blindly error. Session busy protects in-flight via OnIsBusyChange.'),
('ConfirmAssignAsync','Retained exact assignment branch before transient target, stable GUIDperdialog, requires dispatcher. Same pattern outcome and settle. Field initializers restore global per-command keys but constructor no target/modal hydration/initial pending registration, actual native retry reachability needs view validation.'),
('ConfirmOutcomeAsync','Known result UI defaultsdelivered, parses amount ifdelivered; failedreason whitelist options provided but method does not require selected reason or amount<=expected locally, server validates. DTO frozen with requestId/actor before send; no fake delivery event.'),
('OpenDriverAccountAsync','Sets target/clears account/stats, begins accountread then stats. SelectedStatsPeriod change can start its own statsread too; version protects most stale responses. However after first await without currentdriver check it launches olddriver stats with newest statisticsVersion, can replace newdriver stats if account switched/closed midway. Parent statisticspartial alone guard not sufficient across outer sequence.'),
('LoadDriverAccountAsync','Version protects account response/finally. CloseAccount increments both account/statistics generations, clears targets; correct baseclose behavior, but outer Open continuation can start newstats after close and bypass invalidation.'),
('SettleDriverAsync','Pending exact request branch; fresh parses money/difference vs actual custody, reason ifdiff, stacked manager approval only ifdiff and missing permission. After success reload authoritative account+board; can reset _settleRequestId before refresh, but helper cleared only confirmed result.'),
('CompleteOutcomeAsync','Completes2otherhelper actions with serverDTO/board reload; no direct SQLorprinter. Cash disbursement/ledger atomicity remains handler review. Driver PIN fields not cleared success/close until nextopen.')],
'Need fake delayed accountAopenB/close outer stats continuation, reconstructed assign/outcome/settle visible retry, board refresh-age behavior, multi-user global journal scope. No delivery/settlement writes or physical print.',
'Bind all async work to driver/session generation after EACHawait, hydrate pending operation panel, refresh aging intentionally and clear sensitive fields.')
